error[E0100]: ppl has no `===` or `!==`
  ┌─ parse/expressions.ppl:8:13
  │
8 │ const a = x === y
  │             ^^^ use `==` or `!=`
  │
  = note: `==` is already strict: it never converts between types

error[E0106]: `??` can't be mixed with `&&` or `||`
  ┌─ parse/expressions.ppl:9:11
  │
9 │ const b = a ?? b || c
  │           ^^^^^^^^^^^ add parentheses to make the order explicit

error[E0103]: positional argument after a named argument
   ┌─ parse/expressions.ppl:10:22
   │
10 │ const c = f(name: 1, 2)
   │             ----     ^ positional argument
   │             │
   │             named arguments start here
   │
   = help: move positional arguments before the named ones

